# `step: 1` stands behind the tenth of twelve functions. A written constant is as free of effects as a closure: the run behind the birth passes over it and the birth lists it in its place.
# It used to end the run: the functions behind it were made and went through the general define: 66 instructions a call became 506.
# f1 = makeDial
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK-COUNT-12: isMadeOnDemand
# CHECK: = NewObject
